No, but there is a use for having two luckstones...
Spoilers































Put one of them in a sack.  Luckstones only work if you're carrying
them by hand, but then they're susceptible to cursing (is it just me,
or do fountains always seem to go for my luckstone/unicorn horn first
when they decide to curse me)?  If your main luckstone gets cursed,
you can whip out your handy spare in far less time (and therefore with
a cost of far less hard-earned luck) than it might take you to find a
means to uncurse your original.  Particularly useful if you don't have
vast supplies of holy water to waste.



